# ICP Research Framework

## Business Problem

Many B2B companies waste time prospecting businesses that are not ideal customers.

The objective was to build a structured ICP framework that identifies high-quality accounts based on business attributes, technology stack, company size, and market fit.

---

# Goal

Build a repeatable ICP research process that can generate qualified prospect lists for GTM teams.

---

# Research Process

1. Define target industries
2. Define target regions
3. Identify ecommerce technologies
4. Filter by company size
5. Validate business model
6. Identify decision makers
7. Export qualified companies

